                "page_end": 17,
                "page_start": 17,
                "paraphrased": false,
                "text_excerpt": "This simple combination of two guiding prompts shows great promise in further bootstrapping the performance of our proof completion model, achieving a pass rate of 63.5% on miniF2F-test."
              },
              "statement": "Mixture of CoT and non-CoT prompting yields the best overall performance."
