                "page_start": 8,
                "paraphrased": false,
                "text_excerpt": "The subsequent reinforcement learning stage further enhances the model’s performance, improving Pass@K accuracy across all values of K."
              },
              "statement": "Reinforcement learning further enhances performance beyond supervised fine-tuning."
            },
