                "page_start": 8,
                "paraphrased": false,
                "text_excerpt": "The supervised fine-tuning stage, resulting in DeepSeek-Prover-V1.5-SFT, significantly outperforms the base model, with Pass@128 accuracy increasing by approximately two-thirds on miniF2F and doubling on ProofNet."
